INT. CORNER DINER - BOOTH - NIGHT

Tobias, 30s, hunched over a milkshake, scrolls his phone. He looks up. A figure in a trench coat slides into the booth opposite.

Sage, 20s, they/them, buzz cut, an enamel pin that says "SUSPECT". They set a phone face-up on the table.

TOBIAS
You're "DetectiveDuck99"?

SAGE
And you're "NotTheKiller".

TOBIAS
That was a joke!

SAGE
(deadpan)
It's a very bad joke, Tobias.

He laughs nervously. They don't. He stops.

TOBIAS
So who actualy stole Linda's casserole dish?

SAGE
Someone in this group chat. Eleven suspects. Two of them are in this diner right now.

Tobias looks left. Looks right. Looks at the waitress.

TOBIAS
Is it her?

SAGE
It's a milkshake, Tobias. Nobody commited a crime with a milkshake.

They slide the phone across. The screen reads "LINDA: found it lol was in my oven".

Tobias stares. Sage shrugs.

SAGE (CONT'D)
Case closed. You're buying.
